{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":484328,"name":"Ronald Naners","username":"Ronald_Naners","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/r/8baadc/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-06T03:06:06.801Z","cooked":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484328-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484328-where-does-the-bug-appear-featureproduct-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eWhere does the bug appear (feature/product)?\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484328-describe-the-bug-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484328-describe-the-bug-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eDescribe the Bug\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eGrok Bot will not load past the black window with a white loading circle in the center. Same hang on desktop and iOS. Restarting the app does not help. I am not using a VPN.\u003cbr\u003e\nThis started earlier today on iOS, then the desktop app hit the same screen. The UI never appears, so I cannot open Settings, Recover, Update, or Reset from the app.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTroubleshooting already tried\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFully quit and relaunch (not just close the window)\u003cbr\u003e\nNo VPN\u003cbr\u003e\nWaited on the loading screen after restart\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484328-steps-to-reproduce-3\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484328-steps-to-reproduce-3\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eSteps to Reproduce\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSteps to reproduce:\u003cbr\u003e\nOpen the app\u003cbr\u003e\n“Setting up Grok Bot’s Computer”\u003cbr\u003e\nLittle grok bot guy turns into a solid white dot and just hangs\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-484328-screenshots-screen-recordings-4\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-484328-screenshots-screen-recordings-4\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003eScreenshots / Screen Recordings\u003c/h3\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"lightbo